                "retweet_count": 69,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Whenever they use \"the nation's finances\" or deficits as an excuse, remember that they voted for a budget that -- even with the huge Medicaid cuts -- will add $3 trillion in debt to pay for tax cuts mostly for corporations and wealthy people. That's what they're saving up for.",
