                "retweet_count": 269,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "They've gone from demanding work requirements for Medicaid recipients to saying low income Americans who ARE working should be kicked off.\n\n(Note - this is code for getting rid of Medicaid expansion, which covers 25 million Americans making up to 138% of of poverty level wages.)",
