                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "It's interesting that even these 12 \"dissident\" Republicans seem to accept eliminating Medicaid for very low income working adults - which would take  health care from over 20 million Americans.\n\nWhich means that GOP leadership is planning cuts even more devastating than that.",
